- EDEN_TASK_DROP_TARGET: dropped task-program mesh draws counted by draw-time depth configuration
  (zeta address/enable/format/size/layers, depth test/write/func) and rt0; printed at the first drop and
  every 4096 (045 review, Finding 2). EDEN_TASK_DROP_CAPTURE: the same for each captured frame.
- EDEN_TEXTURE_HANDLE_ZERO gains key= (Environment::NativeKey), so black surfaces map to shaders.
  Rendering unchanged.

